"text":"A view of the matching rows, as of this moment."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"type":"heading","anchor":"discussion","text":"Discussion","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Each row is a tuple of the entity, labeled ","type":"text"},{"code":"entity","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", followed by one value per term: the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"component for a component term, and a tuple of optionals for an ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/AnyOf"},{"text":" term. The","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"following example reads the name of every entity pushed by wind, thrust or both, with the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"forces it feels:","type":"text"}]},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":["var world = World()","world.spawn(Name(value: \"kite\"), Wind(force: 3))","world.spawn(Name(value: \"rocket\"), Thrust(force: 5))","world.spawn(Name(value: \"rock\"))","","var forces: [String] = []","for (_, name, (wind, thrust)) in world.query(Query(Name.self, AnyOf<Wind, Thrust>.self)) {","    forces.append(\"\\(name.value): \\((wind?.force ?? 0) + (thrust?.force ?? 0))\")","}","print(forces)","\/\/ Prints \"[\"kite: 3.0\", \"rocket: 5.0\"]\""]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The rock holds neither a wind nor a thrust, so it doesn’t match the "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/AnyOf"},{"type":"text","text":" term."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The view is lazy: it finds the matching entities as you iterate it.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"aside","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"O(","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"t"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"text":") for ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"t","type":"text"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"text":" terms to create. Iterating is O(","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"n","type":"text"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"text":") for ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"n"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"text":" entities in the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"smallest component term or required type, or every entity when there’s none.","type":"text"}]}],"style":"note","name":"Complexity"}]}],"references":{"doc://WorldModule/documentation/WorldModule/World/query(_:)-4yi98":{"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Returns the entities that match a query, with the values of its terms."}],"role":"symbol","title":"query(_:)","url":"\/documentation\/worldmodule\/world\/query(_:)-4yi98","fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"query","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"<each ","kind":"text"},{"text":"T","kind":"genericParameter"},{"text":">(","kind":"text"},{"text":"Query","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:11WorldModule5QueryV"},{"text":"<repeat each ","kind":"text"},{"text":"T","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":">) -> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"QueryView","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:11WorldModule9QueryViewV"},{"text":"<repeat (each ","kind":"text"},{"text":"T","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"kind":"text","text":")."},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Value","preciseIdentifier":"s:11WorldModule9QueryTermP5ValueQa"},{"kind":"text","text":">"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/World\/query(_:)-4yi98","kind":"symbol","type":"topic"},"doc://WorldModule/documentation/WorldModule/World/query(_:)-3e8od":{"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Returns the entities that hold every one of the given component types, with those"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"components."}],"role":"symbol","title":"query(_:)","url":"\/documentation\/worldmodule\/world\/query(_:)-3e8od","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","